Ladybird resolves the transform of a non-transformable element, such
as a non-replaced inline, against a 0x0 box. Chrome 158 does the same:
Blink’s ComputedStyleUtils::ReferenceBoxForTransform() returns an empty
rect for anything that’s neither a LayoutBox nor an SVG child. WebKit
26.5 gives the same result when run. Firefox 151 resolves it against
the inline box, in Gecko’s nsComputedDOMStyle::GetTransformValue().
